      },
      "text": "The JARM signature for sinitude[.]com has been found on numerous servers. Many of these servers have also acted as Cobalt Strike beacon C2 servers. During the course of our investigation, we found that this JARM signature was also found on C2 servers associated with the malware family BazarLoader. BazarLoader, among other things, contains code and application guardrails that makes sure it is not running on a Russian computer.",
