        "section": "rule",
        "sentence_id": "p4_r1"
      },
      "text": "By looking at network traffic since the beginning of this year, we found that several IP addresses are connected to sinitude[.]com. However, our data indicates that only one IP address (back in January) actually created a full connection to communicate with the C2. This IP address is located in Kharkiv, the second largest city in Ukraine. This Kharkiv IP address itself has communicated with unique malware families and is part of the TOR network.",
